### LOCALHOST

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5000/user


### Create user
POST http://localhost:5000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "username": "newuser",
  "name": "New User"
}

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:5000/user/6a9c27359d997c5c40013197


### Update user
PUT http://localhost:5000/user/6a9c27359d997c5c40013197
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "username": "updateduser",
  "name": "Updated User"
}


### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:5000/user/6aa599f4bccb54841c94db13
